{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想讓社交平台的貼文更搶眼，卻不想花時間逐張裁圖？InstantGrid 可以把照片分割成整齊的拼圖版面，或將全景照切成可左右滑動的連續畫面，預覽滿意後才匯出。無論個人檔案，還是經常發佈內容的創作者與品牌，都能做出更吸引的版面。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂行列與全景分割模式</h2>\n<p>InstantGrid 讓你把任何照片快速分割成拼圖版面，可自行設定行數與欄數，並選擇經典方形或直向格式。遇上旅行拍下的寬闊全景照，程式會自動切換至全景模式，做出可左右滑動的震撼效果。匯出前可先預覽成品，確保效果理想，無論生日、婚禮或假期照片，都能變成搶眼貼文，適合內容創作者與品牌使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-297-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-298-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-299-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-300-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-301-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：InstantGrid</li>\n<li>應用類別：Social Networking</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:21.479424+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}